# Keeps this directory in version control while its CONTENTS stay ignored.
#
# data/ holds the Hugging Face datasets cache. SQuAD 1.1 is downloaded here by
# the datasets library and is never committed: a copy in git is a copy that can
# silently diverge from the canonical dataset, after which a metric can no longer
# be traced to a known revision of known data.
#
# Override the location with HF_HOME. See docs/dataset-policy.md.
